1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Travel APIs process millions of transactions daily,
price lookups, booking confirmations, payment flows.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Any one of them can be tampered
before the request reaches the server.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
RouteZero finds those vulnerabilities
before attackers do.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The root cause is a missing automated
security layer in the travel API pipeline.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
RouteZero is an agentic, real-time Dynamic Application
Security Testing engine built for travel platforms.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Four stages: Discover, Map, Exploit, and Remediate.
All autonomous. No human input.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Here is the live security console. You can point it
at any travel API — TBO staging, MakeMyTrip, Cleartrip, or any custom host.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
One click triggers the full autonomous loop.
No manual configuration. No scripting.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
RECON, PLANNER, EXECUTOR, VERIFIER agents
execute in sequence against the target host.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Four confirmed vulnerabilities. Price tampering. Cross-agency IDOR
leaking passport data. A zombie route exposing discount codes.
And a shadow admin route revealing internal credentials.

11
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Every finding includes a reproducible curl command
and a targeted code fix.

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
This is not a theoretical flag. It is a confirmed exploit
with server response evidence.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:30,000
The full scan result exports as an OpenAPI 3.0 specification,
ready for any CI/CD pipeline or security dashboard.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:45,000
RouteZero operates within strict safety boundaries.
Scope allowlist, rate limiter, and an instant kill switch.
Safe to run in staging or controlled production environments.

15
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Built by Team RouteZero for VoyageHack 4.0.
Sai Santhosh, Dharani, Arun Hitesh, Mythreyan, and Ravi Kiran.

16
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Live at saisanthosh31.github.io/routezero.
Full source code on GitHub.

17
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:18,000
RouteZero.
Find it before they do.
